{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21946","headline":"登乐游园望 · 白居易","name":"登乐游园望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"独上乐游园，四望天日曛。\n东北何霭霭，宫阙入烟云。\n爱此高处立，忽如遗垢氛。\n耳目暂清旷，怀抱郁不伸。\n下视十二街，绿树间红尘。\n车马徒满眼，不见心所亲。\n孔生死洛阳，元九谪荆门。\n可怜南北路，高盖者何人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21946.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21946","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}